{"unit_id":"Li3NGa__DHS-multi-agent-plugin#card-zh","repo":"Li3NGa/DHS-multi-agent-plugin","commit":"a6e8190e40672be483c0648d2a1b7e82e70ff7ea","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DHS Multi-Agent 是面向 DSH 的多智能体编排插件，通过 Cordis 插件入口注入 agents 服务并提供 multiAgent API。它可按任务依赖调度 agent，支持顺序、接力、广播和 DAG 执行，并提供任务超时、取消、规划路由、有限恢复与运行诊断。适合需要把复杂工作拆成多个任务并分派给 DSH agent 的开发者。需要运行在提供 DSH agents 和 Cordis 的宿主环境中；插件代码没有声明额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-multi-agent/src/index.ts:48-80","packages/dsh-multi-agent/src/dsh.ts:28-46","packages/dsh-multi-agent/src/scheduler.ts:1-30"]}
